Redface 2 v0.54.1 — dev.

- Quotes: truncation no longer splits URLs, smileys or emojis; no more duplicated quick quote after rotation.
- Topics: scroll-to-post survives a refresh; image reanchoring stays on its page.
- Super favorites: no server removal from an orphaned pin; pins are stored per account.
- Flags: refreshes are serialized across tabs; colors: reliable save when leaving the screen.
